sgp 2

given
  r = 4.5
  k1 = circle(O)
    r1: r(k1) = r

construct
  point A on k1
  point B on k1
  segment OA
  segment OB
    θ1: ∠AOB = 70°
  segment AB

find
  d1: |AB|

where
  k1 r 4.5
  A (4.228616793536588, 1.5390906449655093)
  B (7.107179188443381e-16, 4.5)
  r1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  θ1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  d1 label (0.3, 0.3)
